{"id":"NCT07039916","title":"Study to Assess the Efficacy and Safety of IMVT-1402 in Participants With Mild to Severe Generalized Myasthenia Gravis","official":"A Phase 3, Multicenter, Randomized, Placebo-Controlled, Double-Blind Study to Assess the Efficacy and Safety of IMVT-1402 in Patients With Mild to Severe Generalized Myasthenia Gravis","summary":"The purpose of the study is to assess the efficacy, safety and tolerability of IMVT-1402 in adult participants with mild to severe generalized myasthenia gravis.","conditions":["Generalized Myasthenia Gravis"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"IMVT-1402"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"IMVT-1402"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Placebo"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"IMVT-1402"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Participants with the ability to understand the requirements of the trial, provide written informed consent, and comply with the trial protocol procedures.\n* Have mild to severe gMG by Myasthenia Gravis Foundation of America (MGFA) classification of Class II, III, or IVa at the Screening Visit\n* Have an MG activities of daily living (MG-ADL) score of ≥ 6 at the Screening Visit and Baseline Visit (Day 1)\n\nAdditional inclusion criteria are defined in the protocol.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Have experienced myasthenic crisis within 12 weeks prior to the Screening Visit.\n* Have had a thymectomy performed \\< 6 months prior to the Screening Visit or have a planned thymectomy during the study\n* Have any active or untreated malignant thymoma\n\nAdditional exclusion criteria are defined in the protocol.","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"80 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":231,"start":"2025-05-27","pcd":"2027-12","upd":"2026-11-13","sponsor":"Immunovant Sciences GmbH","areas":["neurology"],"central":["Central Study Contact · 18007970414 · clinicaltrials@immunovant.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Site Number - 1056","city":"Huntsville","pr":"Alabama","zip":"35801","s":"R"